      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "The MARCEL OraLis experience",
        "heading": "Everyday Care, Thoughtfully Refreshed",
        "subheading": "",
        "text": "A well-rounded oral hygiene routine includes regular brushing, cleaning between teeth and an appropriate mouthwash step. MARCEL OraLis is designed to complement these daily habits, not replace them.",
        "center": false,
        "columns": "3",
        "media": "icon",
        "card_style": "benefit",
        "accent": "green",
        "intro_badge": "M",
        "intro_title": "Care Beyond Teeth & Gums",
        "intro_text": "<p>Oral care also means being mindful of the soft tissues inside the mouth. MARCEL OraLis is designed to complement everyday oral hygiene as part of a broader approach to oral cleanliness and freshness, not only brushing for teeth.</p>",
        "intro_note": "OSMF awareness: persistent burning, tightness, restricted mouth opening, ulcers or unusual red or white patches need assessment by a qualified dental or medical professional. MARCEL OraLis has not been shown to prevent OSMF or to reduce the risk of developing it.",
        "ticks": "",
